      "writtenOn": "2018-02-07T19:40:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried this with a charge-through hub and yes, that seems to happen. However, I couldn\u0027t find anything in the PD spec that says that\u0027s an issue or would lead to ErrorRecovery. SoftReset leaves the data roles alone and we seem to renegotiate our contract and perform a data role swap even though the hub maintains its UFP role. See http://screen/fwrMpOg68qr.\n\nI\u0027ll keep re-reading to see if I missed anything.",
